## Active Design Decisions

These are constraints that affect current and future implementation.

### Architecture & Layering

<!-- HOUSE STYLE defaults; adjust to this project's architecture. -->
- Four-layer clean architecture: `domain/` → `application/` → `infrastructure/` + `presentation/`
- Presentation depends on application only — never domain or infrastructure
- Domain has zero framework dependencies

